*

# Root application source, UI, scripts, and documentation.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!REBOOT_HANDOFF.md
!SLOT_MATH_REFERENCES.md
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!*.cjs
!*.js
!*.html
!*.sh

# Small artwork required by the launcher UI.
!images/
!images/**
!game-icons/
!game-icons/**

# Math/configuration metadata; runtime credentials and captures stay local.
!data/
!data/**
data/launcher-auth*.json
data/launcher-file-runtime.json
data/*setup*token*
data/*.bak
data/*.backup
data/egt-protocol-captures.jsonl
data/egt-captures/
data/egt-math-reports/
data/egt-migration-queue.json
data/discovery-cursors.json

# Defensive generated/runtime exclusions.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
**/.runtime/
**/.playwright*/
**/output/
**/*.log
**/*-assets.zip
